    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>QUARTER FIVE\u00a0</strong>is a linear, 15-30 minute &quot;Seek and Find&quot; game about Artificial Intelligence taking our jobs and the eerie reality of working in a corporate office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876700/extras/80974de8c3c7b84a72d839f5bf6ee471.poster.avif?t=1753967692\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876700/extras/80974de8c3c7b84a72d839f5bf6ee471.webm?t=1753967692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876700/extras/80974de8c3c7b84a72d839f5bf6ee471.mp4?t=1753967692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOUR OBJECTIVES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each stage, identity strange anomalies of unknown origin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow strange orders from a suspicious manager.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a story of Artificial Intelligence replacing human jobs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the corporate ladder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get fired!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876700/extras/e528cf6a372b7d4a655c7c09d1d90a77.poster.avif?t=1753967692\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876700/extras/e528cf6a372b7d4a655c7c09d1d90a77.webm?t=1753967692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876700/extras/e528cf6a372b7d4a655c7c09d1d90a77.mp4?t=1753967692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876700/extras/72e65663e6903242e9cb9c43eaa12765.poster.avif?t=1753967692\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876700/extras/72e65663e6903242e9cb9c43eaa12765.webm?t=1753967692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876700/extras/72e65663e6903242e9cb9c43eaa12765.mp4?t=1753967692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876700/extras/cf40853a6e9da5ee0a38c7ec2934b57d.poster.avif?t=1753967692\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876700/extras/cf40853a6e9da5ee0a38c7ec2934b57d.webm?t=1753967692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876700/extras/cf40853a6e9da5ee0a38c7ec2934b57d.mp4?t=1753967692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
